        <mxCell id="title-banner" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px;&quot;&gt;Figure 4. Deterministic Egress Packet Flow via PSC Network Attachment, ACT (ALL_TRAFFIC) &amp; Cloud NAT (/32)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#5f6368&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;Google Cloud — Step-by-Step Packet Routing from Google Managed Tenant VPC into Customer VPC and Out to AWS&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafd;strokeColor=#1a73e8;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=16;fontColor=#1a73e8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
